{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2646": "NIKOLAI: 您好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2647": "INNKEEPER: 哦，你好……尼古拉？尼古拉·普罗赫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2648": "NIKOLAI: 是的，女士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2649": "INNKEEPER: 哟，还“是的，女士”呢！看来当兵总算把你喂壮实了些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2650": "NIKOLAI: 我，呃，只是来确认手下的住宿安排好了没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2651": "INNKEEPER: 哦，安排好了，没问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2652": "INNKEEPER: 离开镇子前来吃顿晚饭吧，我那两个女儿可都还住在家里呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2653": "NIKOLAI: 眼下还有很多事要办，不过谢谢您的好意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2654": "INNKEEPER: 哦，当然……普罗赫上士。呵呵呵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innTherme-2655": "INNKEEPER: 哦，随时欢迎……普罗赫上士。呵呵呵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeWoman1-2656": "Woman: 怎么又来个当兵的！先说好，我可是正经……等等，是尼古拉？欢迎回家！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeWoman2-2657": "Woman: 首都是什么样的？你见过总理吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeMan1-2658": "Man: 士兵们兜里有钱是好事，不过早些打个招呼就更好了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeMan1-2659": "MAN: 尼古拉？尼古拉·普罗赫？哎呀！过得怎么样？多久没见了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeMan2-2660": "MAN: 不，我没有……等等，尼古拉？哎呀！迪特里希见到你，肯定高兴坏了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeMan2-2661": "MAN: 孩子们，跟普罗赫先生问好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeSoldier1-2662": "SOLDIER: 指挥部让我们到这村子集合，没说为什么，催得倒是挺急。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeSoldier2-2663": "SOLDIER: 乡下姑娘一般都喜欢穿军装的，可我怎么就没这运气？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeSoldier3-2664": "SOLDIER: 喂，别把军饷全花在乡下的便宜啤酒上，有你后悔的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeGirl1-2665": "GIRL: 当兵的没乡下小伙那么臭，可我姐姐说，他们爱“动手动脚”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeGirl2-2666": "GIRL: 那些杠杠都是什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeBoy1-2667": "BOY: 您好，呃……普洛克先生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeOldWoman1-2668": "OLD WOMAN: 别以为我不敢揍动手动脚的军官，想得美！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeOldWoman1-2669": "OLD WOMAN: 等等……是尼古拉·普罗赫？哦！还在当兵啊？欢迎回家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-flirtingOfficer-2670": "OFFICER: 说实话，我更喜欢乡间，那才是我们民族精神的根源。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-centerOfficer-2671": "OFFICER: 别让我逮着你在这儿干蠢事，指挥部可盯着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-chillingSoldier1-2672": "SOLDIER: 我们昨天到的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-chillingSoldier2-2673": "SOLDIER: 坐了一夜火车，又走了两天才到，这到底是要干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-diceSoldier1-2674": "SOLDIER: 一星期没掷出过七点了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-diceSoldier2-2675": "SOLDIER: 说真的，我平时更喜欢打牌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-diceSoldier3-2676": "SOLDIER: 团里肯定还有人想玩两把吧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-thermeSeller-2677": "SALESMAN: 别急，小伙子们，人人都有份。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-lineSoldier1-2678": "SOLDIER: 但愿还热着……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-lineSoldier2-2679": "SOLDIER: 别告诉我，这里也卖光了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-lineSoldier3-2680": "SOLDIER: 只要热乎，再浇点奶油酱，皮鞋我都吃得下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-lineSoldier4-2681": "SOLDIER: 我这是要排一整夜啊？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-lineSoldier5-2682": "SOLDIER: 旅馆的炖菜看着不怎么样，所以……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeWife-2683": "WOMAN: 唉……不知道现在去趟农场，还能不能在天黑前赶回来。可东西都快用光了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeWife-2684": "OLD WOMAN: 等等，尼古拉？哦！见过你父亲了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-ThermeGirl3-2685": "GIRL: 好多人！我要躲着，等村子恢复正常再说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-chillingOfficer-2686": "OFFICER: 别玩过头，明早就有新命令了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-talkingSoldier1-2687": "LIEUTENANT: 现在想往上升……得在政界有人脉才行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-talkingToSoldiers-2688": "OLD MAN: 从来都是这样，以前靠皇帝，现在换成总理罢了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-talkingSoldier2-2689": "SOLDIER: （这些老家伙真是……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-bakerySoldier-2690": "SOLDIER: 我们还没到，一排就把面包店买空了，这帮混蛋！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-springsOldGuy-2691": "OLD MAN: 偶尔会有游客来泡温泉，可从没这么多人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-springsSoldier2-2692": "SOLDIER: 那温泉看着真诱人，可我一进去，准有哪个兵来翻我的背包。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-springsSoldier1-2693": "SOLDIER: 听着倒像是你会喜欢的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-drunkSoldier-2694": "SOLDIER: 我也想进去，不过已经七杯啤酒下肚了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-thirdWheel-2695": "SOLDIER: （我还真没想好，要不要一辈子当兵……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-barSoldier1-2696": "SOLDIER: 能来个人招呼一下吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-barSoldier2-2697": "SOLDIER: 我？没有，我没醉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-barSoldier3-2698": "SOLDIER: 有更烈的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-barSoldier4-2699": "SOLDIER: 这杯得慢慢喝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-barSoldier5-2700": "SOLDIER: 接下来几个星期，我有种不太好的预感。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-tavernGirl-2701": "BARMAID: 来的士兵一批比一批没礼貌……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-boothSoldier1-2702": "SOLDIER: 不，我觉得打不起来。难道要一路走到韦尔希纳？去征服一个比我们大一倍的国家？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-boothSoldier3-2703": "SOLDIER: 可要是虚张声势，这阵仗也太大了。再说，吓唬谁呢？总理可不跟人谈判。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innWeiss-2704": "WEISS: 嘿，班长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innWeiss-2705": "NIKOLAI: 怎么，下士，今晚倒没喝上头？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innWeiss-2706": "WEISS: 其实我在上个镇子就把军饷花光了，不过您要这么说也行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innCook-2707": "OLD MAN: 生意多了，我们当然高兴，可军队要是能早点通知，别只提前一天，那就更好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-tavernBellhop-2708": "MAN: 对，对，当兵的包，除了自己谁都不准碰……行吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innOfficer2-2709": "OFFICER: 稍息，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innOfficer1-2710": "OFFICER: 放松点，上士，眼下可是你的休假时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2711": "MUELLER: 等等，我还以为卢斯基亚人人都能用魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2712": "MUELLER: 他们革命不就是为了这个吗？让人人都有魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2713": "KONITZ: 算是吧。应该说，理论上是让人人都能享受魔法的好处，所以才有那场革命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2714": "KONITZ: 真正有资格施法的，还是只有政委……我是说，法律允许的只有他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2715": "MUELLER: 那是怎么回事？军官不是得经过一个特殊的仪式，才能用魔法吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2716": "KONITZ: 对，就是升格仪式。不过，获得魔法的办法不止一种，卢斯基亚人有他们自己的仪式。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2717": "KONITZ: 就连伊纳人，按他们的信仰，成年时也要举行仪式，靠这个获得魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2718": "MUELLER: 可伊纳人和卢斯基亚人的魔法更差，对吧？比不上我们军官那种纯正的魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2719": "KONITZ: 训练手册和宣传画上是这么写的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2720": "NIKOLAI: 住宿都安排好了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2721": "MUELLER: 是，班长，都好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2722": "MUELLER: 那这些仪式，到底有什么区别？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-innConvo-2723": "KONITZ: 我……也说不清。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-wakeDietrich-2724": "DIETRICH: 看右边窗外，就能看见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier1-2725": "SOLDIER: 可没人告诉我们，咱们还有一支飞空战列舰队……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier2-2726": "SOLDIER: 总理做到了……我们将天下无敌！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier3-2727": "SOLDIER: 真不敢相信……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier4-2728": "SOLDIER: 我们还没赶到前线，仗就会打完了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier5-2729": "SOLDIER: 会飞的船？总理还藏着什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier6-2730": "SOLDIER: 到底在哪儿造的，竟能一直保密？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier7-2731": "SOLDIER: 看来我有机会挣几枚勋章了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier8-2732": "SOLDIER: 但愿敌人没有这种东西……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier9-2733": "SOLDIER: 偏挑昨晚熬到天亮，真会选时候……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningSoldier9b-2734": "SOLDIER: 我们要把卢斯基亚烧成平地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningOldman-2735": "OLD MAN: 我们一直觉得总理不是寻常人物，现在更确信了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningMan-2736": "MAN: 简直……像在做梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningOfficer-2737": "OFFICER: 上士，你的人已经在镇口集合了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningWoman-2738": "OLD WOMAN: 不好啊……这仗开头就是这样，结局只会更可怕……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningWoman-2739": "OLD WOMAN: 路上要带些补给吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningAltmayer-2740": "ALTMAYER: 该出发了，上士，往东南走，过河就是斯特拉尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningMueller-2741": "MUELLER: 班长，看见了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/thermeNpcs.yarn-morningKonitz-2742": "KONITZ: 做出这种东西，需要多先进的技术……简直无法想象！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/checkpointNpcs.yarn-soldierL-3793": "SOLDIER: 抱歉，上士，大家都得留在战区内。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/checkpointNpcs.yarn-soldierR-3794": "SOLDIER: 抱歉，上士，上头的命令是不许通行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/checkpointNpcs.yarn-soldierLriver-3795": "SOLDIER: 没有书面命令，不能通过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/checkpointNpcs.yarn-soldierRriver-3796": "SOLDIER: 谁都不准过，您知道规矩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/checkpointNpcs.yarn-soldierCriver-3797": "SOLDIER: 不准通行，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/checkpointNpcs.yarn-riverOfficer-3798": "OFFICER: 指挥部准有人……上士，您该走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-entryGuard1-3799": "SOLDIER: 对，这里就是斯特拉尔。（别问我为什么来这儿……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-entryGuard2-3800": "SOLDIER: 等等，你们不是突击部队？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-entryGuard3-3801": "SOLDIER: 火焰战舰没给我们留下多少活儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-taskOfficer-3802": "LIEUTENANT: 上士，可别让安赛茨上校那样的人等你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-attache-3803": "SOLDIER: 安赛茨的部队在西边，不过得绕开堵住的街道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-waitingSoldier-3804": "SOLDIER: 那个叫什么的上校把物资全拿走了，我只好在这儿等着拦下一辆卡车。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-prisonSoldier1-3805": "SOLDIER: 他们要我们等火车到站后，把一大批平民送上去。仗还打着呢，总觉得怪怪的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-prisonSoldier2-3806": "SOLDIER: 到底要把这些人送去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-pacingSoldier-3807": "SOLDIER: 别处还缺弹药和燃烧弹呢，凭什么都给这个安赛茨拿走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-cornerSoldier1-3808": "SOLDIER: 小心点，城里还有几支民兵在活动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-cornerSoldier2-3809": "SOLDIER: 烟散开的时候，偶尔能看见前线真正交战的火光。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-cornerSoldier3-3810": "SOLDIER: 城里还有几股雷津民兵，留神点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airman1-3811": "ENGINEER: 没看见我忙着修这东西吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airman2-3812": "SOLDIER: 连工具都是全新的……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airSoldier1-3813": "SOLDIER: 真不敢相信，能这么近看着它。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airSoldier2-3814": "TECHNICIAN: 真的还有五十艘？而且一直没人知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airSoldier6-3815": "SOLDIER: 至少我不用上前线，那帮人可有苦头吃了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airSoldier7-3816": "SOLDIER: 这船该怎么弄，我连装懂都装不来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airCornerSoldier-3817": "SOLDIER: 安赛茨？对，就在西边，不过路得你们自己找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airCornerSoldier2-3818": "SOLDIER: 嗯？对，前阵子有个上校从这里过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-airSoldier5-3819": "SOLDIER: 驻守城里的人都快不够了，他们倒舍得派一整个排来修这东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-resident1-3820": "OLD WOMAN: 可是，呃……怎么说……房顶坏了。求求……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-orderingSoldier-3821": "SOLDIER: 我叫你回屋里去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-prisonSoldier1a-3822": "SOLDIER: 谢了，城里还有几个死硬分子在乱窜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-prisonSoldier1b-3823": "SOLDIER: 我们这边应该没问题，押送俘虏挺顺利的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-monsterSoldier-3824": "SOLDIER: 小心点，指挥部说，舰队释放出的魔力正在把野生生物往城里引。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-monsterSoldier-3825": "SOLDIER: 走在城里，也得留神那些野兽。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-notKnow-3827": "MAN: 我，呃……不知……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-stralInterrogator-3828": "LIEUTENANT: 我知道这城里有法师，你们最好有人把他们藏在哪儿说出来，否则可就有苦头吃了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-noAuslene-3829": "MAN: 我不说奥斯伦语。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-guardAa-3830": "SOLDIER: 您不是我们要的雷津语翻译吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-guardAb-3831": "SOLDIER: 这些蠢货，一句奥斯伦语都不会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerGuard1-3832": "SOLDIER: 听说上校跟总理是至交，想法也差不多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerGuard2-3833": "SOLDIER: 不用上前线，我是挺高兴，可这差事也让人高兴不起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zrodloMateusz-3834": "MATEUSZ: 我盯着你呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zrodloPavel-3835": "PAVEL: 你来之前，我们真不知道该怎么办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzGuard1-3836": "SOLDIER: 上校？对，就在北边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzGuard2-3837": "SOLDIER: 您被派到安赛茨上校的部队了？他就在前面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-officerZ1-3838": "OFFICER: 谁肯说出城里的法师藏在哪里，谁就能回家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzGuards-3839": "SOLDIER: 这里交给我们，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzMover1-3840": "SOLDIER: 我们能替您清开这条路，过一会儿再来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzMover2-3841": "SOLDIER: 我们拿点装备来清理，给几分钟就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerSoldier1-3842": "SOLDIER: 我主动报名来这里，他们才把我从牢里放出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerSoldier2-3843": "SOLDIER: 这可比以前在医院干的那些事刺激多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerSoldier2a-3844": "SOLDIER: 在老家，处理掉谁家的姑妈或邻居，总有人来吵。这里就没这烦恼！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerSoldier3a-3845": "SOLDIER: 您不觉得上校那些兵怪怪的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerSoldier3b-3846": "SOLDIER: 这份差事，我真有点拿不准……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-lingerSoldier4-3847": "SOLDIER: 我可兴奋了，要知道这些事放在别处干，可是要挨罚的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-azOfficer2-3848": "OFFICER: 我从一开始就跟随上校了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-azOfficer2-3849": "OFFICER: 整个帝国，只有上校有远见、有胆量完成我们的使命，当然，总理阁下除外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-getToItStral-3850": "OFFICER: 动手吧，上士，留意那些像是被火焰“守着”的建筑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzOfficerG-3851": "OFFICER: 这里没什么可看的，上士，继续搜查吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-detonator_soldier-3852": "SOLDIER: 得赶紧把雷管拿回来，不然上校可真要发火了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor1-3853": "WOMAN: 嘘，孩子们，别出声，跟着走，咱们就不会有事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor2-3854": "GIRL: 可爸爸呢？没有爸爸，我不走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor3-3855": "BOY: 得回去把火扑灭！我们的东西全在里面……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor4-3856": "WOMAN: 但愿阿格涅什卡和孩子们离得够远……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor5-3857": "MAN: 他们不可能把农场也炸了啊，那根本说不通，我们还会再见到他们的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor6-3858": "BOY: 他们为什么要伤害妈妈和玛娅？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor7-3859": "YOUNG WOMAN: 没事的，等逃出这里，一切就都会好起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor8-3860": "YOUNG MAN: 还没找到未婚妻，街上就全是军队了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor9-3861": "YOUNG MAN: 楼上两层的公寓都被炸没了，我真不知道自己怎么活下来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-zSurvivor10-3862": "OLD MAN: 我辛苦一辈子攒下的一切……几分钟就全烧光了，到头来图什么呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-ravinePavel-3863": "PAVEL: 你们先走，我们带其他幸存者跟上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-blockade1soldier-3864": "SOLDIER: 我们只是拦着，免得有人逃走，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-blockade2soldier-3865": "SOLDIER: 上校没发话，不能过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-anseitzOfficerK-3866": "OFFICER: 这里一切都在掌握之中，上士，走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/stralNPCs.yarn-miscStralGuard-3867": "SOLDIER: 我们这里没问题，上士。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/seizholtzBattle.yarn-nikolaiSeizholtzBattle-4166": "Seisholtz: 普罗赫，你真给我们丢脸！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/seizholtzBattle.yarn-nikolaiSeizholtzBattle_int-4167": "Seisholtz: 怎么了，普罗赫？没胆了吗！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/seizholtzBattle.yarn-nikolaiSeizholtzBattle_int-4168": "Seisholtz: 你太弱了，普罗赫！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/seizholtzBattle.yarn-nikolaiSeizholtzBattle_int-4169": "Seisholtz: 以为我就这点本事！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/nikolai/seizholtzBattle.yarn-nikolaiSeizholtzBattle_int-4170": "Seisholtz: 都向我靠拢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3278": "Title: 森林深处",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3279": "Description: 尼古拉带领小队，深入野蛮人盘踞的森林。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3280": "Title: 林中洞穴",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3281": "Description: 尼古拉的小队搜索洞穴，寻找恶名昭彰的阿平戈里克斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3282": "Title: 追击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3283": "Description: 阿尔特迈尔上尉的炮击打散了野蛮人。追击阿平戈里克斯！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3284": "Title: 安顿住宿",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3285": "Description: 尼古拉前往旅馆，确认小队的住宿安排。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3286": "Title: 温暖的家",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3287": "Description: 去面包店探望尼古拉的父亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3288": "Title: 战鼓响起",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3289": "Description: 召集尼古拉的部下，离开村庄。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3290": "Title: 开拔令",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3291": "Description: 向东南方行军，前往斯特拉尔城。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3292": "Title: 前往报到",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3293": "Description: 在城西找到安赛茨上校。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3294": "Title: 扑救火灾",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3295": "Description: 调查看似受到魔法火焰“保护”的房屋。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3296": "Title: 擅离岗位",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3297": "Description: 科尼茨跑走了，去找他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3298": "Title: 轰燃",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3299": "Description: 跟上那个男人，逃离火场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3300": "Title: 隐藏的机关",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3301": "Description: 找到打开神殿内门的隐藏开关。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3302": "Title: 记忆之舞",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3303": "Description: 跟随神秘的魔像。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3304": "Title: 地下河",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3305": "Description: 为幸存者找到离开兹鲁德沃的道路。"
}
